(Troubleshooting tree) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Pick the symptom, then the capture. Change one thing.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (No audio, agent shows Available ? Microphone permission, then UDP 3478, then VPN on the) Tj
T* (media path. \(lab webrtc\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (ice_collection_timeout ? DNS for TurnNlb from that PC. \(lab webrtc\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Flow error and an empty Lambda log ? Association and the Lambda resource policy.) Tj
T* (AccessDenied never reaches your function. \(lab lambda-sim\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Lambda log is fine and the flow took Error ? Response shape or the 8-second wait. \(lab) Tj
T* (lambda-sim\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Caller hears silence and the contact ends ? An error branch is not connected. Read the flow) Tj
T* (log for that ContactId. \(lab flow-log-reader\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Wrong queue answers ? Priority and delay on the profile, not the queue name. \(lab) Tj
T* (routing-designer\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Recording missing ? Block enabled, bucket policy, key policy, then one new test call. \(lab) Tj
T* (find-fault\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (CTR missing after a minute ? Wait. Five quiet minutes is the point to read Firehose errors.) Tj
T* (\(lab ctr-inspector\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Screen pop is the wrong person ? ANI matched a household. Pop the account id the flow) Tj
T* (collected. \(lab ecosystem-map\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (WFM adherence is blank ? One agent event, a status map, and a published schedule. \(lab) Tj
T* (wfm-adherence\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (911 would reach headquarters ? The stored profile address is stale. Validate, store, test) Tj
T* (with 933. \(lab e911-checker\)) Tj
